---
// Ex-date price adjustment arithmetic: 1,000 shares @ 30,000 VND receiving 2,000 VND cash + 20% stock dividend.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

const W = 900;
const H = 295;
---
<figure class="sbp5-adj">
  <div class="sbp5-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Before and after Ex-Date math: 1,000 shares at 30,000 VND (30 million total) before Ex-Date become 1,200 shares at 23,350 VND adjusted reference price (28.02M) plus 2.0M cash dividend (1.9M after 5% PIT) on Ex-Date morning.">
      <text x="20" y="30" class="sbp5-title">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Why the share price drops on Ex-Date morning — total pre-tax value stays unchanged</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Vì sao giá tham chiếu tự giảm vào sáng Ngày GDKHQ — tổng tài sản trước thuế không đổi</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Before box */}
      <rect x="20" y="54" width="380" height="218" rx="10" class="sbp5-card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="bank" x={48} y={84} size={24} />
      <text x="74" y="88" class="sbp5-hdr">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Close before Ex-Date (Cum-Dividend)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Đóng cửa trước Ngày GDKHQ</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="38" y="124" class="sbp5-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Shares held: 1,000 shares</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Số lượng giữ: 1.000 cổ phiếu</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="38" y="152" class="sbp5-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Closing price: 30,000 VND</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Giá đóng cửa: 30.000 đồng</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="38" y="180" class="sbp5-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Announced action: 2,000 đ cash + 20% stock</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Quyền: 2.000 đ tiền mặt + 20% cổ phiếu</tspan>
      </text>
      <line x1="38" y1="204" x2="382" y2="204" class="sbp5-sep" />
      <text x="38" y="236" class="sbp5-hdr">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Total equity value = 30,000,000 VND</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tổng giá trị tài sản = 30.000.000 đồng</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Center formula arrow */}
      <line x1="410" y1="158" x2="480" y2="158" class="sbp5-line" />
      <polygon points="480,152 490,158 480,164" class="sbp5-arrow" />
      <text x="450" y="138" text-anchor="middle" class="sbp5-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>(30k − 2k) ÷ 1.2</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>(30k − 2k) ÷ 1,2</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* After box */}
      <rect x="500" y="54" width="380" height="218" rx="10" class="sbp5-card-red" />
      <DiagramIcon name="ok" x={528} y={84} size={24} />
      <text x="554" y="88" class="sbp5-hdr sbp5-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Ex-Date 09:00 Reference = 23,350 VND</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tham chiếu sáng GDKHQ = 23.350 đ</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="518" y="124" class="sbp5-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• 1,000 current + 200 waiting shares = 1,200 CP</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• 1.000 CP sẵn + 200 CP chờ về = 1.200 CP</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="518" y="152" class="sbp5-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Share value: 1,200 × 23,350 = 28,020,000 đ</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Giá trị cổ phiếu: 1.200 × 23.350 = 28.020.000 đ</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="518" y="180" class="sbp5-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Gross cash: +2,000,000 đ (−100k PIT = +1.9M)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Tiền cổ tức: +2.000.000 đ (trừ 5% thuế = +1,9M)</tspan>
      </text>
      <line x1="518" y1="204" x2="862" y2="204" class="sbp5-sep" />
      <text x="518" y="236" class="sbp5-hdr">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Total pre-tax ≈ 30.02M (tick rounding)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tổng trước thuế ≈ 30,02M (chênh làm tròn tick)</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Dividends are never "free extra money" appearing out of thin air: on Ex-Date morning HOSE adjusts reference price downward by the cash paid out and divides by the new share multiplier (rounded to valid tick 23,350 VND).</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Cổ tức không phải "tiền miễn phí từ trên trời rơi xuống": sáng ngày GDKHQ, sàn trừ đúng phần tiền chia ra khỏi giá và chia đều cho số cổ phiếu mới tăng thêm (làm tròn bước giá HOSE thành 23.350 đồng).</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sbp5-adj { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sbp5-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .sbp5-adj svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .sbp5-adj text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sbp5-title { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp5-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .sbp5-card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp5-hdr { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp5-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .sbp5-body { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .sbp5-sub { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp5-sep { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .sbp5-line { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 2; }
  .sbp5-arrow { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp5-adj figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
